 "result": "Call order at the end of a request (all paths under `src/tessel/`):\n\n1. `Tessel.finalize_request` (`app.py:1021`) is called from the dispatch path at `app.py:1019`, or from the error path at `app.py:948`. It first runs `self.make_response(rv)` (`app.py:1224`).\n2. `Tessel.finalize_reply` (`app.py:1394`) runs the `after_request` functions. If the session isn't a null session, it then calls `session_interface.persist_session(...)` (`app.py:1415-1416`).\n3. `SignedCookieSessionInterface.persist_session` (`sessions.py:337`) does the cookie work:\n   - It reads the cookie settings through the `get_cookie_*` helpers.\n   - It adds `Vary: Cookie` if the session was accessed.\n   - It calls `response.delete_cookie(...)` if the session was modified and is now empty.\n   - It returns early if `cookie_needs_write(...)` is false.\n   - Otherwise it works out the expiry with `get_expiration_time`, signs the data with `make_signer(app).dumps(dict(session))`, and calls `response.set_cookie(...)` (`sessions.py:374`).\n\nThe default `session_interface` is `SignedCookieSessionInterface()` (`app.py:250`).",
